# simple_graph_stable_packing_twelve_seed_supergraph_rigidity

Topic: graphs   Node: ed5e761dc2c5

Provenance: helper lemma. Finite rigidity of the stable connected-family obstruction; experiments 16978, 16981, 16983 and symmetry census 16984.

For the displayed 20-vertex, 60-edge seed, any supergraph on the same vertices in which every edge lies in at least two triangles and which has no thirteen edge-disjoint triangles is exactly the seed.
-/

